n* test(host): a handed menu limits federated reads end to end\n\n* fix(federation): close CTE, cast and INTO holes in scoped reads\n\n* fix(host): scope from every handed menu, owner-based, cache-safe\n\n* fix(insights,cases): narrow every verb, deliveries and raw reads\n\n* fix(host): key the scope and policy caches on the store instance","tree":{"sha":"b1a0932048582d0e0b7b970cc8378a9ce284340d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/trees/b1a0932048582d0e0b7b970cc8378a9ce284340d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/commits/32f07bbb75b0abf06a555a9c14ced6b96a36e665","verification":{"payload":"tree b1a0932048582d0e0b7b970cc8378a9ce284340d\nparent 87ec6ccc73e2392f885661611e16dd56237c1c85\nauthor Binod <binodrayee@gmail.com> 1790089351 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790089351 +0400\n\nfeat: entity-scoped data — one workspace, per-team site access (#221)\n\n* feat(federation): narrow a scoped read to its entities'' rows\n\n* test(federation): dry-run board SQL through a row policy\n\n* feat(host): scope federated reads to the caller''s handed entities\n\n* feat(insights): narrow insights to the caller''s handed entities\n\n* feat(insights): drop watch events outside the caller''s entities\n\n* feat(cases): narrow cases to the caller''s handed entities\n\n* test(host): a handed menu limits federated reads end to end\n\n* fix(federation): close CTE, cast and INTO holes in scoped reads\n\n* fix(host): scope from every handed menu, owner-based, cache-safe\n\n* fix(insights,cases): narrow every verb, deliveries and raw reads\n\n* fix(host): key the scope and policy caches on the store instance","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqspiHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxN0QAIy9P1tiFod1GsXmVf6w77MO\nkvDqFHszuzHI9+mXndUmIRSFzgA4Ec6YZO21YDK/QD2pkUNGdInLLtWi3ozFDARy\nfJDaDY/+PMGxIvtwGb8pKMjDdoJEMYoWAGb4tX9cx/mYy+0CzOhfVIkMA3sdURut\nMQJ3BvXxlEUiyEpNT/E4x659/X7dWk2l4e6biIyxgZzs+Ghb2paRs+Ti2VSTk/Il\npgGg0lGYjdeN2iQ7m