parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lb/commit/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453","sha":"fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453"}],"sha":"87ec6ccc73e2392f885661611e16dd56237c1c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/87ec6ccc73e2392f885661611e16dd56237c1c85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47450908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JemyJenesh","id":47450908,"login":"JemyJenesh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDUwOTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:59:37Z","email":"47450908+JemyJenesh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jenesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:59:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(nav): pin a curated menu row — nav:<navid>/<rowid> (#209)\n\n* feat(nav): a curated menu row is pinnable — nav:<navid>/<rowid>\n\nA board bound to variables and a folder that opens its own board had no pin ref, so a curated site\nmenu drew no pin anywhere. NavItem gains a stable id (nav.save keeps / mints / re-mints duplicates,\nrefuses malformed); ResolvedItem echoes it, and a row pin resolves through the pick tiers'' readability\ngate and the ordinary resolve_item pipeline, carrying nav_id + trail. A folder pins as its board; hide\nbeats pin; every miss strips silently. No new caps, verbs or migration.\n\n* feat(nav): a pinned folder keeps everything inside it\n\nFlattening a pinned folder to its board silently dropped the pages under it. A folder row pin now\nresolves as the menu does — a group with its subtree (and its own board beside it), hidden pages\nstripped via strip_hidden — and a folder with no board of its own is pinnable too.","tree":{"sha":"7ffd617d2ef0c15e866238eff145431b57b6fde8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/trees/7ffd617d2ef0c15e866238eff145431b57b6fde8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/commits/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ffd617d2ef0c15e866238eff145431b57b6fde8\nparent 58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2\nauthor Jenesh <47450908+JemyJenesh@users.noreply.github.com> 1790017177 +0545\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790017177 +0400\n\nfeat(nav): pin a curated menu row — nav:<navid>/<rowid> (#209)\n\n* feat(nav): a curated menu row is pinnable — nav:<navid>/<rowid>\n\nA board bound to variables and a folder that opens its own board had no pin ref, so a curated site\nmenu drew no pin anywhere. NavItem gains a stable id (nav.save keeps / mints / re-mints duplicates,\nrefuses malformed); ResolvedItem echoes it, and a row pin resolves through the pick tiers'' readability\ngate and the ordinary resolve_item pipeline, carrying nav_id + trail. A folder pins as its board; hide\nbeats pin; every miss strips silently. No new caps, verbs or migration.\n\n* feat(nav): a pinned folder keeps everything inside it\n\nFlattening a pinned folder to its board silently dropped the pages under it. A folder row pin now\nresolves as the menu does — a group with its subtree (and its own board beside it), hidden pages\nstripped via strip_hidden — and a folder with no board of its own is pinnable too.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsX6ZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAouQQAGDwy5Otjykkx5GMwcesT2Kn\na+JGNRpl8EVi2TAAFnLxQfc6nkl8QSTGnaCxNGHxBUb8BHPELpjCcR08MwOh+fJ4\nr2hTwxef9fT9BgMedzjOIuMQyKDDhp9xmB4whG2tUSDHXlAzNQ9h1D1BMM1RYPAE\ngwGl+6u9OKCeD4lB7Wj93Ud4HHoacqXkpaj/KHgpVOY8VKP20E5sLdOKFgIaRfls\n9ndBqvutFjdbBeacdCgITQr3dyOTiIAQkWEiEDCjg4g9g0Lv/x5GhOpM1YmqQhCR\nMOKPLZfM7jWwcYe8zdQ6ZoswGGW4yK12w4kRRQS2+iJqSKPO92mApPDDbB1iHoXF\nk3SbnHWkXAnF468OP3sVLwYSK1Ke1v16YX0+CQCXyhNonlAKozsuIWdIrVNlu0uX\nF2sD3RU5Sd7t+vNjMpqSXZO3LIcJ0x6CQL1DNx+Wnr1AMjT33oBCG95GFJwMLnnb\nHEImmM25WqEF0hZnzKuE7P4eHQEMpBMXH03lRaAwzHZe2sC6rhrDeG2AYuEYQqGk\ncvYUz3L987rmwpvxvZZHdepR4pa/SR5wgZUmGT/sLYBWUmMWx8kAMhkj5CmlrmrY\nxPzz4It97zURzvG4JGnTHdlVD8QvI5Y+P5YQ7sCJLn62ELSYwGksxrcJ/eCMvy7p\n/Pksnad390cIDJjIvCAQ\n=tsTH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T18:59:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lb/commit/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453","node_id":"C_kwDOTFiyodoAKGZlMzhlYmI0MzhkMjNhZWEwMDFlMzJjM2M2ZjA0NDVjMDM2NDU0NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/lb/commit/58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2","sha":"58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2"}],"sha":"fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/fe38ebb438d23aea001e32c3c6f0445c03645453"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47450908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JemyJenesh","id":47450908,"login":"JemyJenesh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDUwOTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JemyJenesh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/commits/58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:58:39Z","email":"47450908+JemyJenesh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jenesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:58:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(nav): a surface entry relays its vars — a page''s query parameters (#218)\n\nresolve_surface built every surface entry with an empty vars, so a\nnav.save''d surface item kept its vars in the store (nav.get showed them)\nbut they never reached nav.resolve. It now relays item.vars verbatim, the\nway a dashboard entry''s pinned binding already rides. The UI appends them\nto the page link as plain ?<key>=<value> (a menu entry that opens a page\npre-filtered). Opaque data; the core neither reads nor checks them.\n\nTest: nav_surface_vars_test pins both doors (nav.get + nav.resolve).","tree":{"sha":"8e774ebfc60bb2c3b2aa30c5806f931234aec09f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/trees/8e774ebfc60bb2c3b2aa30c5806f931234aec09f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/lb/git/commits/58c262f99b7c35bbaa0791062ff3ac69479f83d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e774ebfc60bb2c3b2aa30c5806f931234aec09f\nparent 6eee53221938e0a14deb5d5dbe190114f37ba4ff\nauthor Jenesh <47450908+JemyJenesh@users.noreply.github.com> 1790017119 +0545\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790017119 +0400\n\nfeat(nav): a surface entry relays its vars — a page''s query parameters (#218)\n\nresolve_surface built every surface entry with an empty vars, so a\nnav.save''d surface item kept its vars in the store (nav.get showed them)\nbut they never reached nav.resolve. It now relays item.vars verbatim, the\nway a dashboard entry''s pinned binding already rides. The UI appends them\nto the page link as plain ?<key>=<value> (a menu entry that opens a page\npre-filtered). Opaque data; the core neither reads nor checks them.\n\nTest: nav_surface_vars_test pins both doors (nav.get + nav.resolve).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsX5fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANI0QAItKQnnOW4mpsDAMW4IIdCVE\n3srz5ua3BGXcyk1hyjFS5xTiL9MkUCx06ZgQ1cmpttZ0LotejTQNsnODimhsJ2O0\nasjMqRt7Xj9Iq3Q4gBXhkxJG7kRBqIdG8DN541l0Nd9kz/r/ngf4tbFZ1Ykki1aa\neAhqJ6D9MfT/QbM6c5ecgP43kFNC0qxTMPh/1WWJXQDl8DyNFWJEcc/drDuY3Jdz\nBXOJuSyfTPvH0/mE4z3/qgxYfKs0dZYkt24mb6pakhhtaqFjrzk6DmazGzH7ebaa\nCxDEs