ithub.com/users/HongDaeEui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HongDaeEui","id":43264739,"login":"HongDaeEui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjY0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/7e332b2593e1c4716f048188940cde77df0c802f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T23:22:22Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T23:22:22Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"message":"UX 개선 2차: 마스코트 반응, 결과 공유 카드, 분석 이벤트 기반\n\n- 마스코트 반응: 차례 표시를 캡슐 폰 말풍선으로 교체, 표정 5종(보통·웃음·놀람·고민·시무룩) + 상황별 대사\n- 결과 공유 카드: 퍼즐 결과를 마스코트·시도 이모지·연속 기록 카드로 미리 보고 이미지(휴대폰)/텍스트로 공유\n- 분석 이벤트 기반(src/analytics.ts): 첫 실행·온보딩·레슨·퍼즐·단계·무르기·공유·알림·설정 이벤트. 서비스 연결 전에는 전송 없음\n- 아이콘 스크립트: 마스코트 얼굴을 표정별로 분리해 생성\n- 기획 문서·로드맵 갱신, 테스트 110개\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91ac189f9d15aa78422b423dbf6fa8ad7a05df49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/trees/91ac189f9d15aa78422b423dbf6fa8ad7a05df49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/commits/7e332b2593e1c4716f048188940cde77df0c802f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43264739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user