i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/2dc13a7ea2433aa6d280a082437bb4dfc95a1eda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:59:41Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:59:41Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"message":"UX 개선 1차: 홈 재설계, 무르기, 퍼즐 힌트, 매일 퍼즐 알림\n\n- 홈: 🔥 연속·★ 별·⚙️ 설정, 오늘의 퍼즐 카드(연속 동기 부여/다음 퍼즐 카운트다운), 원탭 이어하기 + 진행 막대\n- 게임: \"내 차례 / AI가 생각 중…\" 표시, 무르기(AI 대전은 AI 수까지 함께), 큰 화면 보드 400px\n- 데일리 퍼즐: 💡 힌트(공유 결과에 표시), 풀고 나면 카운트다운과 단계별 도전 이어하기\n- 매일 아침 9시 퍼즐 알림: 첫 퍼즐 성공 후 opt-in, 기기 내 예약, 설정에서 켜고 끄기, Android 알림 아이콘\n- 개인정보처리방침·스토어 가이드에 알림 반영, 스토어 스크린샷 갱신\n- 기획 문서 docs/ux/UX_PLAN.md, 테스트 100개\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1adea64a022a9b650299906dbaf541a7e365dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/trees/a1adea64a022a9b650299906dbaf541a7e365dfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/commits/2dc13a7ea2433aa6d280a082437bb4dfc95a1eda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43264739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HongDaeEui","id":43264739,"login":"HongDaeEui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjY0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/orgs","