hub.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/c85657f5f469a7ee7c89548e2340eada98a8d167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:16:58Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:16:58Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"message":"스토어 출시 준비: 개인정보처리방침, 스토어 이미지, Play Console 가이드\n\n- 개인정보처리방침 (한국어·영어 한 페이지, site/privacy) — 데이터 수집·광고 없는 현재 버전 기준\n- 스토어 이미지: Play 아이콘 512, 대표 이미지 1024x500 (한/영)\n- 휴대폰 스크린샷 1080x2160 한/영 6장씩, scripts/store-screenshots.mjs로 실제 앱을 자동 촬영\n- docs/store/google-play.md: 스토어 설명문, 앱 콘텐츠 답안, 비공개 테스트 절차, 테스터 모집 문구\n- 작은 휴대폰에서 홈 화면 로고·메뉴가 잘리던 문제 수정 (스크롤 가능하게)\n- 아이콘 스크립트의 브라우저 찾기 코드를 scripts/lib/browser.mjs로 분리\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b28e078ab864090820949bdf5ce53cfdd1825334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/trees/b28e078ab864090820949bdf5ce53cfdd1825334"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/commits/c85657f5f469a7ee7c89548e2340eada98a8d167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43264739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HongDaeEui","id":43264739,"login":"HongDaeEui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjY0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dayainow/dayainow/commit/c85657f5f469a7ee7c89548e2340eada98a8d167","node_id":"C_kwDOTFufotoAKGM4NTY1N2Y1ZjQ2OWE3ZWU3Yzg5NTQ4ZTIzNDBlYWRhOThhOGQxNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dayainow/dayainow/commit/806625120dd5c972b9a6aa051a49ff46c96fe908","sha":"806625120dd5c972b9a6aa051a49ff46c96fe908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/806625120dd5c972b9a6aa051a49ff46c96fe908"}],"sha":"c85657f5f469a7ee7c89548e2340eada98a8d167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/c85657f5f469a7ee7c89548e2340eada98a8d167"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43264739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HongDaeEui","id":43264739,"login":"HongDaeEui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjY0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/commits/806625120dd5c972b9a6aa051a49ff46c96fe908/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:47:41Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:47:41Z","email":"aviate8@gmail.com","name":"dayainow"},"message":"캡슐체스: tiny-chess-app 프로토타입에서 분리해 출시 준비 시작\n\ndayainow/dayainow의 tiny-chess-app(5x5 미니 체스 프로토타입)을 이어 받아\n독립 저장소로 분리하고, 스토어 출시를 목표로 다음을 구현함.\n\n- 규칙: 합법 수, 체크/체크메이트/스테일메이트 판정, 폰 승급\n- AI: 미니맥스 + 알파베타 + 실수 확률, 난이도 3단계, N수 메이트 풀이기\n- 화면(expo-router): 홈, 체스 배우기(레슨 8개), 오늘의 퍼즐, 단계별 도전(20단계), 자유 대전, 설정\n- 데일리 퍼즐 550개 생성·내장, 연속 기록, 결과 공유\n- 첫 실행 환영 안내, 이동 애니메이션, 효과음·진동, 승리 색종이\n- 브랜딩: 캡슐체스/Capsule Chess, 캡슐 속 폰 아이콘, 캡슐 팔레트\n- 한국어·영어, 진행 기록 저장, 앱 권한 최소화, EAS 빌드 설정\n- 테스트 92개 (Jest), 생성·시뮬레이션 스크립트\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7164e7541aa9ae6072102b5521167bc69179e6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/trees/a7164e7541aa9ae6072102b5521167bc69179e6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dayainow/dayainow/git/commits/806625120dd5c972b9a6aa051a49ff46c96fe908","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43264739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HongDaeEui","id":43264739,"login":"HongDaeEui","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjY0NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HongDaeEui","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dayainow/dayainow/commit/806625120dd5c972b9