9f326dc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hermes-agent-deployer/commits/f6245553bec71c1df99b2f7867c3eca9f326dc91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32554862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erwangranger","id":32554862,"login":"erwangranger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hermes-agent-deployer/commits/6e785cf511839e6a99b3a70a5891546cee56a89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T17:55:24Z","email":"32554862+erwangranger@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Erwan Granger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T17:55:24Z","email":"32554862+erwangranger@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Erwan Granger"},"message":"Rebuild hermes-sandbox image: multi-stage build, auth, agent dir\n\nContainerfile:\n- Multi-stage build (builder + runtime) on UBI9 python-312\n- Install hermes-agent from source (v2026.7.20) and hermes-webui (v0.52.76)\n- Use pip instead of uv (QEMU ARM→x86 segfault workaround)\n- Add tini as PID 1, OCI labels, healthcheck\n- Pin Playwright/Chromium with runtime smoke test\n- Remove git from runtime stage\n\nEntrypoint:\n- Fix pipefail crash on empty env var grep (|| true)\n- Fix shell injection in HERMES_CONFIG_* (os.environ vs interpolation)\n- Hardcode venv python path (UBI9 PATH override workaround)\n- Add HERMES_ENV_* (.env upsert) and HERMES_CONFIG_* (yaml merge)\n- Set HERMES_WEBUI_AGENT_DIR=/opt/hermes/src (fixes agent features)\n- Auto-generate WebUI password when not provided\n- HERMES_WEBUI_NO_AUTH=true disables built-in auth (for OAuth proxy)\n- Add startup banner and config summary\n\nResources:\n- Auto-set HERMES_WEBUI_NO_AUTH=true when OAuth proxy is enabled\n\nMakefile:\n- Add image-build-sandbox and image-push-sandbox targets\n- Use REGISTRY/SANDBOX_IMAGE_NAME:IMAGE_TAG for sandbox image ref\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e069468f2b7cf736ab37e90c39b3bf0e2cbedf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hermes-agent-deployer/git/trees/7e069468f2b7cf736ab37e90c39b3bf0e2cbedf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hermes-agent-deployer/git/commits/6e785cf511839e6a99b3a70a5891546cee56a89c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32554862?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erwangranger","id":32554862,"login":"erwangranger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU0ODYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erwangranger/starred{