/Shreyash019/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyash019/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyash019","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyash019/Event-Driven-ABAC-RAG/commits/5223896e30402538b8b9471dda254f9f8ab52b50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T18:22:05Z","email":"shreyashgaur1@gmail.com","name":"Shreyash019"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T18:22:05Z","email":"shreyashgaur1@gmail.com","name":"Shreyash019"},"message":"feat: introduce company-wide role ladder and seniority levels\n\n- Added DeptRank enum to define in-department roles with ordinal inheritance for visibility.\n- Replaced isManager boolean in UserDepartment model with rank field using DeptRank.\n- Introduced level field in User model to represent company-wide seniority, defaulting to L3.\n- Updated Permission model to include minLevel for permission access based on user level.\n- Modified seed data to include level for users and adjusted permissions to reflect new minLevel requirements.\n- Updated various services and DTOs to accommodate changes in user and department models.\n- Enhanced RBAC checks to include org-level floor based on user level.\n- Adjusted frontend forms to manage user levels and ranks.\n- Created migration script to apply changes to the database schema.","tree":{"sha":"44c94decb9b33570ec852d8ab85f0f2b4288293e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyash019/Event-Driven-ABAC-RAG/git/trees/44c94decb9b33570ec852d8ab85f0f2b4288293e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyash019/Event-Driven-ABAC-RAG/git/commits/5223896e30402538b8b9471dda254f9f8ab52b50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106344324?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyash019/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https:/