update frontend-build to fix install issues (#1553)\n\nEarlier versions of @openedx/frontend-build used on older version of\n''sharp'', which caused intermittent installation issues. The version of\n''sharp'' was updated in @openedx/frontend-build to fix these issues, so\nthe frontend-build version can be updated here, to fix the issues in\nthis project too. See\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/issues/664 and\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/pull/665 for more information.\n\nThe frontend-build dependency was updated by:\n\n```\nnpm install --package-lock-only @openedx/frontend-build\n```\n\nPrivate-ref: https://tasks.opencraft.com/browse/BB-9953","tree":{"sha":"44caa3577b06fd2e2a8f1fbfca47bfc93f872e6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pselleh/frontend-app-authn/git/trees/44caa3577b06fd2e2a8f1fbfca47bfc93f872e6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pselleh/frontend-app-authn/git/commits/b97f777b6fe926ada4163df710e14edc0ecb63e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 44caa3577b06fd2e2a8f1fbfca47bfc93f872e6b\nparent b2f75790540a21513417b002a616f27426d29e39\nauthor Samuel Allan <samuelengineer@fastmail.com> 1757360390 +0930\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757360390 -0600\n\nfix: update frontend-build to fix install issues (#1553)\n\nEarlier versions of @openedx/frontend-build used on older version of\n''sharp'', which caused intermittent installation issues. The version of\n''sharp'' was updated in @openedx/frontend-build to fix these issues, so\nthe frontend-build version can be updated here, to fix the issues in\nthis project too. See\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/issues/664 and\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/pull/665 for more information.\n\nThe frontend-build dependency was updated by:\n\n```\nnpm install --package-lock-only @openedx/frontend-build\n```\n\nPrivate-ref: https://tasks.opencraft.com/browse/BB-9953","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJovzEHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYbQQAKN