se.yml)\n- Rsdoctor bundle analyzer (RSDOCTOR=true / pnpm analyze) for shell/first-app/second-app\n- axe-core accessibility scans (Playwright E2E + jest-axe for packages/ui)\n- Keyboard nav + ARIA fixes found during the audit: missing accessible name on\n  the task Checkbox, low-contrast focus ring in light mode, misleading close\n  button on the mandatory name modal\n- Fix apps/shell/playwright.config.ts and every app''s rsbuild.config.ts being\n  excluded from tsconfig include (process.env typed as unresolved)","tree":{"sha":"49601ff45bcc843ce80d8ca5506c870476063dfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/git/trees/49601ff45bcc843ce80d8ca5506c870476063dfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/git/commits/d1504b3511101a521067a37e542763d98e897855","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67469007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mytoandeptrai","id":67469007,"login":"mytoandeptrai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDY5MDA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mytoandeptrai/micro-