te_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/commits/ea39313cbb55cacf94469696638524041be0c5b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:18:50Z","email":"67469007+mytoandeptrai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mytoandeptrai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:18:50Z","email":"67469007+mytoandeptrai@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mytoandeptrai"},"message":"feat: phase 2 — team-app MFE + Member CRUD + shared-utils\n\n- Add apps/team-app: Module Federation remote (port 3001)\n  - Bootstrap pattern (index.tsx → bootstrap.tsx)\n  - BrowserRouter with basename /team for standalone mode\n  - App.tsx exposes via MF without router conflict\n  - nuqs for URL state, react-hook-form + zod for edit form\n  - TailwindCSS + postcss config\n  - RTL tests (8/8 passing)\n\n- Add packages/shared-utils: axios HttpInstance\n  - cleanParams strips nulls from query params\n  - qs paramsSerializer\n  - BaseResponseType, PaginatedResponseType matching NestJS TransformInterceptor\n\n- Add apps/api: Member entity + CRUD\n  - Member entity (UUID PK, role/status enum, soft delete)\n  - MembersModule with findAll (pagination + filter), findOne, create, update, softDelete\n  - Restructure: modules/ and shared/database/\n  - 13-member seed data\n  - 13/13 unit tests passing\n  - Fix compression import (esModuleInterop workaround)\n\n- Update apps/shell:\n  - MF remote URL → mf-manifest.json\n  - dts consumeTypes, publicPath /, historyApiFallback\n  - Lazy load teamApp/App at /team/*\n  - Add team.spec.ts E2E tests\n\n- Update packages/ui:\n  - Add shadcn components: Badge, Card, Checkbox, Dialog, Form,\n    Input, Label, Popover, ScrollArea, Select, Sonner, Table,\n    Textarea, Tooltip\n\n- Add templates/remote: MFE remote scaffold template\n\n- Archive openspec phase-2 change","tree":{"sha":"517bba968874b30ed20e41131a5b3977592d7bf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/git/trees/517bba968874b30ed20e41131a5b3977592d7bf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/git/commits/ea39313cbb55cacf94469696638524041be0c5b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67469007?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mytoandeptrai","id":67469007,"login":"mytoandeptrai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDY5MDA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mytoandeptrai","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/commit/ea39313cbb55cacf94469696638524041be0c5b1","node_id":"C_kwDOTGPpt9oAKGVhMzkzMTNjYmI1NWNhY2Y5NDQ2OTY5NjYzODUyNDA0MWJlMGM1YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-boilerplate/commit/ed3bc126862b49bc128527cb4973fbb3a817f405","sha":"ed3bc126862b49bc128527cb4973fbb3a817f405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mytoandeptrai/micro-frontend-