-11T11:18:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Align debt trend gating with normalized context metric (#129)\n\nUse the measured normalized context-footprint debt for comparable trend gates while retaining legacy cognitive debt as a diagnostic. Version the context-debt model in snapshots, warn rather than compare incompatible baselines, and preserve all independent trend gates. Add regression coverage and documentation.","tree":{"sha":"c91e58f65ebc384bad4cf457a0e71426c3f2d9a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carstenartur/ai-knowledge-extractor/git/trees/c91e58f65ebc384bad4cf457a0e71426c3f2d9a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/carstenartur/ai-knowledge-extractor/git/commits/8d5a161d42672fdb7e23796fc26b924a67a2fcf4","verification":{"payload":"tree c91e58f65ebc384bad4cf457a0e71426c3f2d9a8\nparent 014d705b2f62d0ebc8a872082b89aa6ae44006a8\nauthor Carsten Hammer <carsten.hammer@t-online.de> 1789125481 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789125481 +0200\n\nAlign debt trend gating with normalized context metric (#129)\n\nUse the measured normalized context-footprint debt for comparable trend gates while retaining legacy cognitive debt as a diagnostic. Version the context-debt model in snapshots, warn rather than compare incompatible baselines, and preserve all independent trend gates. Add regression coverage and documentation.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo+NpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA29QQAFlKyneC5N73FpIEmhh/mWXw\nayWnGh+HbJCSQq0nl+IPLIBBdsj0/d7uA9gap+YQT7mXDiNG3brn/h+Nza6KmEaQ\nA0l1x1CLB+yBXh9hSc51eoLMOh6yB7DZGWTb/Xd5Sh3Ik2VavcOGlX1kJxu4KBfy\ncYuDTHXLD5HsbFTReloQFl3Q/Ql1W6XKI6OujjRokdWG6AuYZ7GvNUoqajVvWvoQ\n+GRFtZCsQAHcRDWRLld5/ZjnZdfKbHIMEATxAu+I8PTN7n1YLMkyiU57GJ+bV5vW\nFT2eHPd1yJsyn2P1ujTxIZXdYgNgl99sf3y7AoudvBWkUaGXhEjkQ+M1xp6CFaN1\n//tjsQkJ5xS1cshNR1ntZFnTnXXcQhHU5qWpxwPYyXi+uC62JeLl4gcUJIVocail\ncFsV8Sm92iwvxmYHAbMZx28KUlSlLdLnifzaTpBk2Jq57/Dm0MslYYlS7KKpws82\nC+Rkxk6ZxX+DuwyHgaDT0Mc