api.github.com/users/IEatCodeDaily/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IEatCodeDaily/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IEatCodeDaily/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IEatCodeDaily","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/5ee1fe632d40793a7d333fbaeebb34d361dce00b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:47:15Z","email":"IEatCodeDaily@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raisal P Wardana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T08:47:15Z","email":"IEatCodeDaily@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raisal P Wardana"},"message":"feat(scip): real SCIP fixture, relationship enrichment, label normalization\n\n- Add real scip-python index fixture (end-to-end pipeline test)\n- Implement relationship-based enrichment: SCIP ''implements'' relationships\n  inject IMPL edges, ''type_definition'' injects TYPE_OF edges\n- Fix display_name extraction from SCIP symbol strings when indexer leaves\n  it empty (scip-python v0.6.6 behavior) — extract from last descriptor\n- Add normalize_label_for_match: strips ()/params from labels so Synaptic''s\n  ''login()'' matches SCIP''s ''login''\n- Extract display_name from composite descriptors like ''auth/login().(user)''\n- Add integration test suite (6 tests) with real .scip protobuf\n- Add unit tests for normalize_label_for_match and extract_display_name\n- Fix clippy warnings (doc indentation)\n- Apply rustfmt\n\nTests: 1525 workspace pass (was 1510), 46 synaptic-scip pass (was 31)","tree":{"sha":"0af3520651c626175eee5160cb9919a63dce78f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/0af3520651c626175eee5160cb9919a63dce78f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/5ee1fe632d40793a7d333fbaeebb34d361dce00b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,