aughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/2e746e402697b437d7dbffec20cfbef483d15506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T23:03:31Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T23:03:31Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"docs: fix CI docs job - drop private intra-doc link in tool_god_nodes\n\n`pub fn tool_god_nodes` documented a link to the private `god_nodes_page`\nhelper, which rustdoc rejects under `private_intra_doc_links` (fatal with the\ndocs job''s `RUSTDOCFLAGS=-D warnings`). Demote it to a plain code span. No\nbehavior change. Caught by reproducing the exact CI gate locally\n(`cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --all-features --locked`).","tree":{"sha":"4e9844e71c530a2b2a5761b18aec77cfc3d957a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/4e9844e71c530a2b2a5761b18aec77cfc3d957a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/2e746e402697b437d7dbffec20cfbef483d15506","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://ap