ust toolchain (kept in lockstep with\nrust-toolchain.toml and the crate MSRV), not an action version to keep current.\nRust 1.100 does not exist, so every CI job failed at the toolchain install step.\n\nInstead of chasing the latest tag, pin the toolchain to the current stable\nrelease, 1.96.0, and move all three pins together (rust-toolchain.toml, the\nworkspace MSRV, and the dtolnay refs) so CI keeps building at the declared MSRV.\nVerified clean on 1.96.0: fmt, clippy -D warnings, rustdoc -D warnings, and the\nfull test suite (1334 passed).\n\nKeep the genuine action upgrades from the group (checkout v7,\ndependency-review v5, upload-artifact v7, download-artifact v8,\naction-gh-release v3), and add a Dependabot ignore for dtolnay/rust-toolchain\nso the toolchain pin is only ever bumped by hand alongside the MSRV.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN36vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhNUQAG78/DfTvUT4BB/4DXlERObX\noWrugHMlZd+y4BvS7Bkdim6ieAjfpSKV+jvGPnFGES3qgSYbqvbP2McVLnD3NKRt\ny7BjkFWCm2njKCC/j0gjLu4CrVZv69KziohoGGwWkFgY4m1vIEaDDX8YvvZinZRG\nohxdOaTZqx4mUr+FX+KwvildANFBB62lsNz3xwVv8dx6FrCARENjpu8gTxUVCDJc\nKv6CDEiQBoJeuSdpxaXKnEBWOAT3pNaVauib5eje2+9UfoUDq1Iegyle1SMJcRTu\nMzLOafDqCXA1IVIJaViJ8O0Iz2XUyyxoL/70+2nao6E35P4kdDc+7SAxJpfahxYQ\nG8DTGNUrVIDMlFwY1XHEbZS6+fwJMU6d+ZFn9OwykluRHDbfWExEktqz1xUWsBBZ\n7oErdj22t8lLBsk23N6YBJ+33OrcbLmkLC4uPHklutbFPnj8T0xCnN1vOw6iBanL\nNx/OpyefNobTMZhmIiApXzRaVqpt0i2jKP1LCTX32SCY5T7wQohFpzmx5gRMvp2R\niRt0jXfcHjUH9Emw4tEnIXIzjtwAWFKqSpXiDQIklolfTbaOzYfadl+A88V2VahF\nPQ2caDgvwg6inmSxYj+M4kQpF3j4phaVdV5FFF8AnJWP8QvoxNLXlKJ/HShTkTpl\nQDDHGDdzmyg7mSdptVnA\n=67Gk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-27T09:02:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github