d tests clean.\n\n- sqlparser 0.54 -> 0.62: TableConstraint/ColumnOption PrimaryKey, ForeignKey\n  and Unique are now wrapped structs; inline PK is its own ColumnOption::\n  PrimaryKey; IndexColumn wraps an OrderByExpr.\n- redis 0.27 -> 1.2: ConnectionInfo/RedisConnectionInfo fields are private;\n  build via ConnectionAddr + builder setters, read via accessors in tests.\n- hmac 0.12 -> 0.13: new_from_slice moved to the KeyInit trait.\n- getrandom 0.2 -> 0.4: getrandom() renamed to fill().\n- tiktoken-rs 0.6 -> 0.12: decode takes &[Rank] instead of Vec.\n- axum 0.7 -> 0.8: path-param syntax :label -> {label} (runtime panic).\n- criterion 0.5 -> 0.8: criterion::black_box deprecated; use std::hint::\n  black_box across all benches.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"55180a265f6c33c756f9de449c5e48d7c0bc66c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/55180a265f6c33c756f9de449c5e48d7c0bc66c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/4e2483b146531fb25f37d516d665db0ec0a94bc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 55180a265f6c33c756f9de449c5e48d7c0bc66c0\nparent 0810c18b68a2a6726476e95601f08c3690183f92\nauthor Colin Vaughn <Colinvaughn01@gmail.com> 1782019761 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782019761 -0400\n\nChore/deps update (#4)\n\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group with 19 updates\n\nBumps the cargo group with 19 updates:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [axum](https://github.com/tokio-rs/axum) | `0.7.9` | `0.8.9` |\n| [getrandom](https://github.com/rust-random/getrandom) | `0.2.17` | `0.4.2` |\n| [tree-sitter](https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter) | `0.25.10` | `0.26.9` |\n| [tree-sitter-python](https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-python) | `0.23.6` | `0.25.0` |\n| [tree-sitter-javascript](https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-