gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/cd318310d2080d11100a9489399f0d265def5f2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T04:20:02Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T04:20:02Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.3.0: rename CodeGraph to Synaptic (full rebrand)\n\nRename the project across every layer: 22 crates (codegraph-* -> synaptic-*),\nthe CLI binary (codegraph -> synaptic, plus a syn alias), the query language\n(CGQL -> SynQL, .cgql -> .synql), env vars (CODEGRAPH_* -> SYNAPTIC_*), the\ndefault output dir (codegraph-out -> synaptic-out), the ignore file\n(.codegraphignore -> .synapticignore), the MCP server name, generated skills,\nREADME/wiki/CI, and GitHub URLs (ColinVaughn/Synaptic). Adds a Discord banner\nand Star History chart to the README and wiki Home. Version 0.2.12 -> 0.3.0.","tree":{"sha":"0aeaac49093d2a1963f1b81d7cb1e706382eaa63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/0aeaac49093d2a1963f1b81d7cb1e706382eaa63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/cd318310d2080d11100a9489399f0d265def5f2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer