","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/c1fe0bf78c729ca974d810b884fb95ea4238b3de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T21:01:38Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T21:01:38Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.12: bound CLI `affected` output (parity with the MCP tool)\n\nThe CLI `codegraph affected` was still fully unbounded (printed every dependent).\nIt now mirrors the MCP affected tool: a per-depth breakdown, top-N entries, and a\n\"+N more; pass --verbose\" note, via new --limit (default 50) and --verbose flags.\n\nThe MCP affected limit/verbose params (0.2.11) were verified already wired and\nhonored; this closes the CLI gap. Full workspace tests, clippy -D warnings, fmt\nclean; new CLI integration test for the bounding + verbose behavior.","tree":{"sha":"cceae010bc2bbdfda5da49cb91634bab5d17ac05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/cceae010bc2bbdfda5da49cb91634bab5d17ac05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/c1fe0bf78c729ca974d810b884fb95ea4238b3de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","eve