aughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/f51b012e1ce1182eb0cfc0f4f651fdd2159aac81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:37:15Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T20:37:15Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.11: bound affected output + stop HTML-escaping signatures\n\n- affected now gets the summary + top-N treatment the 0.2.9 work applied to\n  predict_impact/audit_sql: a per-depth breakdown, top-N entries, and a\n  \"+N more; pass verbose=true\" note, with new optional limit/verbose params.\n  The structured channel is capped too and adds total/truncated/by_depth.\n- describe_node and structural_search no longer HTML-escape signatures in the\n  structured channel. Generics (Record<string, unknown>, Promise<void>) were\n  coming back entity-encoded because signatures went through the HTML-escaping\n  metadata path. A shared signature_json helper now sanitizes with the plain\n  label rule (control-strip + cap, no entity escaping), preserving the serde shape.\n\nFull workspace tests, clippy -D warnings, fmt clean; new regression tests for both.","tree":{"sha":"abd9550da1bcd70f5742ee7891b9ee576797f352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/abd9550da1bcd70f5742ee7891b9ee576797f352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/f