url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/10e56cee956f3c9e10a865317473cc87b5092b79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:51:45Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:51:45Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.10: follow-up fixes for config-key changed nodes, checklist example, CLI resolver\n\nCloses the three gaps found re-testing 0.2.9:\n\n- predict_impact no longer lists JSON/YAML config keys as changed nodes. The 0.2.9\n  exclusion only caught markdown because the config_key marker was on the edge, not\n  the node. Config-key nodes (package.json/tsconfig keys) and YAML/k8s/CI resources\n  now carry a node-level _node_type, so is_code_symbol excludes them from both the MCP\n  predict_impact response and the CLI forecast.json. Requires re-extraction.\n- predict_impact verify checklist now picks a real code symbol (one with a kind) for\n  its `codegraph affected` example instead of a config/file node.\n- CLI explain/path/affected route through the same resolver as the MCP tools, so an\n  ambiguous name reports candidate ids uniformly instead of \"Node not found\".\n\nFull workspace tests, clippy -D warnings, and fmt clean; new regression tests for all\nthree (JSON config-key tagging, checklist code-symbol preference, CLI ambiguity).","tree":{"sha":"9d3e25b3251eb64f8a814e0c0b7d48f8e93696a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/9d3e25b3251eb64f8a814e0c0b7d48f8e93696a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/10e56cee956f3c9e10a865317473cc87b5092b79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/10e56cee956f3c9e10a865317473cc87b5092b79","node_id":"C_kwDOTGqYB9oAKDEwZTU2Y2VlOTU2ZjNjOWUxMGE4NjUzMTc0NzNjYzg3YjUwOTJiNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834","sha":"11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834"}],"sha":"10e56cee956f3c9e10a865317473cc87b5092b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/10e56cee956f3c9e10a865317473cc87b5092b79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:12:48Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T19:12:48Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.9: agent-tool quality pass (SQL FPs, module-import impact, resolver, output caps)\n\nFixes from driving CodeGraph over a real TypeScript codebase:\n\n- SQL audit false positives: extract SQL only when a string carries the clause\n  its shape requires (UPDATE/SET, DELETE|SELECT/FROM, INSERT/INTO, MERGE/INTO|USING),\n  and drop query-text findings whose snippet does not parse as SQL (placeholders\n  normalized first; Postgres :: casts preserved).\n- predict_edit/plan_rename now resolve module-level importers: import edges record\n  the names they bring in, and the forecast walks module importers back to the symbol\n  (named -> will break / edit site; opaque -> review). No more bare 0 for exported\n  symbols with module importers.\n- Unified node resolver: ambiguous names list candidate ids instead of a misleading\n  \"No node matches\"; consistent () stripping and wording across all name-taking tools.\n- predict_impact changed-node list filtered to code symbols (markdown headings and\n  config keys excluded).\n- predict_impact and audit_sql default to summary + top-N with optional limit/verbose.\n\nBackward-compatible: MCP tool count unchanged; graph.json gains only additive edge\nkeys. Full workspace tests, clippy -D warnings, and fmt clean; benches within noise.","tree":{"sha":"50bedb1e5e6965cea60252d5e73f6edf3ddd50db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/50bedb1e5e6965cea60252d5e73f6edf3ddd50db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834","node_id":"C_kwDOTGqYB9oAKDExMTI0ZDRiYWQ1ODRkMTE2MDdlZDU5YjUwMTM4ZDlhMDU4ZGE4MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/df0355a214d048bbf3586b104c9ebbd987ff019c","sha":"df0355a214d048bbf3586b104c9ebbd987ff019c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/df0355a214d048bbf3586b104c9ebbd987ff019c"}],"sha":"11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/11124d4bad584d11607ed59b50138d9a058da834"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/df0355a214d048bbf3586b104c9ebbd987ff019c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:35:07Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:35:07Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.8: relevance-ranked query_graph + git/recency awareness\n\nquery_graph now ranks results by relevance instead of traversal/lexicographic\norder: best-first expansion over a priority frontier, hub nodes down-weighted so\nthey stop flooding results, length-normalised IDF seeds. Each node carries a\n`score`; nodes and edges come back sorted by it.\n\nAdds optional git/recency awareness: a `since` argument (ref, date, or `auto`)\nboosts nodes whose file changed on the current branch, scoped to\nmerge-base(since, HEAD)..working-tree (includes uncommitted edits), churn-weighted.\n`recency_mode: seed` injects changed-file nodes as seeds to surface the branch''s\nchanged surface. Changed nodes are flagged (changed: true). The CLI exposes the\nsame via --since / --seed-changed. Resolution runs git and degrades gracefully.\n\nHistory gains merge_base and a pure parse_numstat. Backward-compatible: no `since`\nis byte-identical to the prior query path; MCP tool count unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"ec5e15f33cbbc6225712eff2907053f1b66710c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/ec5e15f33cbbc6225712eff2907053f1b66710c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/df0355a214d048bbf3586b104c9ebbd987ff019c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"