NTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/67b6d2095c59597bda9cf11b6e9c2715b370fd5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T23:58:39Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T00:02:29Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"feat: cross-language edges, function signatures, and describe_node (v0.2.4)\n\nTrack A - signatures, structured output, descriptions:\n- Capture function/method signatures (params + return type) into node metadata;\n  surface in graph.json, structured structural_search output, and get_node.\n- New read-only MCP tool describe_node: \"takes X, returns Y, calls Z\".\n\nTrack B - cross-language runtime edges (INFERRED), so impact analysis spans\nlanguage boundaries:\n- Subprocess invocations (invokes) for Python/JS/Go/Rust/Ruby/PHP, resolved to\n  in-repo binaries/scripts.\n- FFI bindings (binds_native): PyO3, ctypes/cffi, JNI, cgo, node-gyp/N-API.\n- HTTP/RPC service boundaries (calls_service/handled_by): Flask/FastAPI, Express,\n  axum/actix, Go net/http (incl. Go 1.22 method patterns), tonic + Python gRPC;\n  clients for requests/httpx, axios/fetch, Go http, reqwest.\n- Cross-file + cross-repo resolution: cross-file axum handlers, two-sided PyO3,\n  parameterized route matching, cross-repo route matching in federation.\n- Comment/docstring/string/raw-string masking + precision guards (reqwest\n  file-gate, gRPC denylist, per-impl method resolution).\n- New codegraph eval cross-language calibration command.\n\nReverse-impact (affected/predict) traverses the four cross-language relations by\ndefault. structural_search and describe_node join the structured-output tools\n(24 read-only MCP tools by default, 25 with --allow-exec).\n\nDocs: new Cross-Language-Edges wiki page; MCP/Querying/Extraction/Commands/\nLanguages pages and the assistant skill updated. Bump workspace version to 0.2.4.","tree":{"sha":"2326937c138a9ae95d4bc2ce521c999fa606bd21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/2326937c138a9ae95d4bc2ce521c999fa606bd21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/67b6d2095c59597bda9cf11b6e9c2715b370fd5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/67b6d2095c59597bda9cf11b6e9c2715b370fd5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTGqYB9oAKDY3YjZkMjA5NWM1OTU5N2