tml_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/d0a8b8b1386cceacd4d4fe79767831f72ad4c620/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:59:32Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:59:32Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.1: fix extract-langs CI, tidy refactor plans, CGQL name matching\n\nThe extract-langs CI matrix was red because the enrichment integration\ntest ran every language''s case under each single-language build, so the\ngrammars that weren''t compiled in panicked on extract. Each test is now\ngated on its own lang feature, matching the fuzz tests.\n\nRefactor plans no longer list the definition and same-file call twice:\nthose sites get a real name-token column and so dedup against the textual\nscan. A trustworthy same-file direct call now lands in the apply set\ninstead of review. Move and extract plans stopped printing \"rename X -> X\"\nfor a name that does not change.\n\nCGQL .name is now the bare symbol, so f.name = \"announce\" matches a\nfunction labelled announce(); use =~ for a substring or regex match.\n\nAlso dropped the leftover \"Phase N\" development comments across the\ncrates and regenerated the agent skill files.","tree":{"sha":"ce736eee166d1562367d6b40e311892eb0f4786e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/ce736eee166d1562367d6b40e311892eb0f4786e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/d0a8b8b1386cceacd4d4fe79767831f72ad4c620","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/d0a8b8b1386cceacd4d4fe79767831f72ad4c620","node_id":"C_kwDOTGqYB9oAKGQwYThiOGIxMzg2Y2NlYWNkNGQ0ZmU3OTc2NzgzMWY3MmFkNGM2MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0","sha":"20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0"}],"sha":"d0a8b8b1386cceacd4d4fe79767831f72ad4c620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/d0a8b8b1386cceacd4d4fe79767831f72ad4c620"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commits/20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T15:45:43Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T15:45:43Z","email":"colinvaughn01@gmail.com","name":"Colin Vaughn"},"message":"Release 0.2.0: time-travel diff, CGQL search, safe refactor\n\nThree new capabilities, each its own crate and CLI command:\n\n- diff: compares the code graph between two git revisions and reports added and\n  removed dependencies, removed APIs, coupling drift, new cycles, and hotspots.\n  --since resolves the base from a date; --html writes a report.\n- search: a small structural query language (CGQL) over the graph, plus the\n  named patterns (singleton, factory, observer, service-locator, god-class).\n  Has variable-length paths, count() aggregation, --explain, and saved queries.\n- refactor: rename, move, and extract produce a confidence-scored plan for an\n  agent to apply, and verify rebuilds and checks the graph afterward. CodeGraph\n  never edits source itself.\n\nAlso adds node metadata (kind, visibility, line spans), fan-in/out and Tarjan\nSCC graph helpers, three new read-only MCP tools (20 total), and an HTML diff\nreport. README, wiki, and benchmarks updated. Version bumped to 0.2.0.","tree":{"sha":"d122b7a0f6902f89c19209bcc8c0e3b127ad0f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/trees/d122b7a0f6902f89c19209bcc8c0e3b127ad0f27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/git/commits/20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62533138?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinVaughn","id":62533138,"login":"ColinVaughn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTMzMTM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinVaughn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/20d9d3813fd852adbbac550c91acd4408cc6f8f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTGqYB9oAKDIwZDlkMzgxM2ZkODUyYWRiYmFjNTUwYzkxYWNkNDQwOGNjNmY4ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IEatCodeDaily/synaptic-scip/commit/8660897d43696833f1924a6fb31954d601b3adff","sha":"8660897d43696833f1