OEBoxwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitechnologysys-sys","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/b4720da9583731dc3c76cd024cc64f3f696e5ca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T18:00:17Z","email":"ai.technology.sys@gmail.com","name":"aitechnologysys-sys"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T18:00:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Chore/rebrand postaryx #4 (#8)\n\n* chore: establish Postaryx product identity across app, sdk, extension, and billing\n\nFork the product identity from Postiz into Postaryx across core user-facing\nand runtime surfaces while preserving compatibility where needed.\n\nIncludes:\n- rebrand frontend, backend, SDK, extension, and translated UI copy to Postaryx\n- rename primary frontend logo asset to postaryx.svg\n- move SDK identity to @postaryx/node with Postaryx API defaults\n- add preferred POSTARYX_* OAuth/env naming with POSTIZ_* fallback support\n- update agency emails and product-facing links to configurable Postaryx domains\n- align extension runtime/manifests to postaryx.com\n- remove hardcoded legacy upload/runtime references in frontend examples\n- make Postaryx extension install URL configurable\n- keep n8n integration as explicit Postiz-compatible/shared integration for now\n- align active Stripe billing metadata/webhook filtering to postaryx\n- retain upstream/legal/compatibility references intentionally where required\n\n* feat(theme): update light and dark color tokens to match brand palette\n\n* feat(typography): align app font stack with landing brand system\n\n* feat(ui): align buttons, inputs, spacing, and elevation with brand system\n\n* chore(frontend): update hardcoded repo links to Postaryx docs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Fahim Shahriar <imnirobs15@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8dba3323222ff240c52cf8e57c4def16f4893012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/trees/8dba3323222ff240c52cf8e57c4def16f4893012"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/commits/b4720da9583731dc3c76cd024cc64f3f696e5ca8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8dba3323222ff240c52cf8e57c4def16f4893012\nparent b2aec465f36cc844b9d08ce08a48f0b725f9216e\nauthor aitechnologysys-sys <ai.technology.sys@gmail.com> 1787853617 +0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787853617 +0600\n\nChore/rebrand postaryx #4 (#8)\n\n* chore: establish Postaryx product identity across app, sdk, extension, and billing\n\nFork the product identity from Postiz into Postaryx across core user-facing\nand runtime surfaces while preserving compatibility where needed.\n\nIncludes:\n- rebrand frontend, backend, SDK, extension, and translated UI copy to Postaryx\n- rename primary frontend logo asset to postaryx.svg\n- move SDK identity to @postaryx/node with Postaryx API defaults\n- add preferred POSTARYX_* OAuth/env naming with POSTIZ_* fallback support\n- update agency emails and product-facing links to configurable Postaryx domains\n- align extension runtime/manifests to postaryx.com\n- remove hardcoded legacy upload/runtime references in frontend examples\n- make Postaryx extension install URL configurable\n- keep n8n integration as explicit Postiz-compatible/shared integration for now\n- align active Stripe billing metadata/webhook filtering to postaryx\n- retain upstream/legal/compatibility references intentionally where required\n\n* feat(theme): update light and dark color tokens to match brand palette\n\n* feat(typography): align app font stack with landing brand system\n\n* feat(ui): align buttons, inputs, spacing, and elevation with brand system\n\n* chore(frontend): update hardcoded repo links to Postaryx docs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Fahim Shahriar <imnirobs15@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkHsxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAD+MQAHSYCN8nKIorTF8ovFqrRlO0\nPx5PWkEkBgefKKR/id86ZKH/USOT82BJdBhFiIEek3/6etahKMdI/ick/i8l5ehK\n/vFaFE8SFeYnFMVdaaT+4gB1MypSIzsXduEsyaRUjMazIGonoUeiuFfxDBOMg4hd\nqttV/PeDrkzQUTUVX1sMia9MxmJbQWVNpt5QLd/1aUFFIM+J2p8gjCK51L6Q8GCP\nTcNW3qqAfjDgCs+svxCKhHyjkz6VIySW2PDnJqrr4VAZsC1wKMl6cuvFB5KCLkkZ\nvcfWO/k0pwbB460JTzxggfhkLx8uxb0M77dGKXLh4gvh45dvreF8aBJKeyLmEcIl\nHMNa8VPXPmzij/7xJYCy2UEM9kY49ATrfwfLTUtAVsRt8aul8RezWL1leFAZev6H\ndXLHQVjkId4CIXDdTRRd5VAhomGt0LiHPRcmyILQqc3FvxqTMgTklsYel+OTEgHv\nRe7ncYzK5Bz3eRowbs3WObIJhhoFtfOY21eX6zmhWIOyV8oz4VXfeGiPW0OK2oez\nD9+rV3rxte10MexVXVdejrQaCJJSSEu4Ey7AssjQASNnYsUAJH2GHXEu7RyHBLhw\n3zik7WmCNs1AG1R912q+Tl+zcDP8z5ExCc78jrqHpVn1gePAv1vKfVtNb+CZfgmP\nqZOelzbWuIG0MUOV8Y+o\n=VZpz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T18:00:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use