_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23434985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Koushik-Deb","id":23434985,"login":"Koushik-Deb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM0OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commit/19b0f31c9a0440cfa8d7b45082d42a3a4e45ac77","node_id":"C_kwDOTGyzLNoAKDE5YjBmMzFjOWEwNDQwY2ZhOGQ3YjQ1MDgyZDQyYTNhNGU0NWFjNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commit/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3","sha":"0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3"}],"sha":"19b0f31c9a0440cfa8d7b45082d42a3a4e45ac77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/19b0f31c9a0440cfa8d7b45082d42a3a4e45ac77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23434985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Koushik-Deb","id":23434985,"login":"Koushik-Deb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM0OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:45:23Z","email":"koushik.imon@gmail.com","name":"Koushik Deb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:45:23Z","email":"koushik.imon@gmail.com","name":"Koushik Deb"},"message":"chore(billing): pin Stripe API version, switch back to Stripe, update docs\n\nPin the Stripe API version explicitly rather than inheriting whatever\nthe installed stripe-node happens to pin:\n\n    const STRIPE_API_VERSION = ''2026-02-25.clover'';\n\nUpstream passes no apiVersion. Pinning means a dependency bump can''t\nsilently shift the wire format, and it makes the coupling to the\nwebhook endpoint''s API version explicit — a mismatch across a major\nversion fails silently, not loudly (paymentSucceeded() reads\ninvoice.parent.subscription_details, absent before 2025-03-31.basil, so\nit would early-return { ok: true } and never fire purchase tracking).\n\nNote the deployed webhook endpoint sits on 2025-12-15.clover — the\naccount default, and the newest clover the dashboard offers. Same major\nas the SDK, which is the bar that matters; the date strings need not be\nidentical. Do not \"fix\" this by casting the pin down: apiVersion is\ntyped as a literal alias of the SDK''s own version.\n\nDocs rewritten for the current state: BILLING_ENABLED as the gate,\nStripe as the active provider with Polar parked, where each Stripe\ncredential comes from, ngrok/Stripe CLI webhook setup, API version\nguidance, and what to create in Stripe test mode (nothing — Postiz\nfind-or-creates Products and Prices by name match at request time).\n\nAlso includes a debug log of validated webhook event types in\nStripeController, useful while the webhook is being brought up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"615b2e0328aae1b77510a6599f7aa97d69a101a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/trees/615b2e0328aae1b77510a6599f7aa97d69a101a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/commits/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23434985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Koushik-Deb","id":23434985,"login":"Koushik-Deb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM0OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commit/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3","node_id":"C_kwDOTGyzLNoAKDBjYzhjOGY3OTA3OTcwODY0MjA4ZDgyNzljNWQxOGQ1YWE4Y2M1YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commit/14c0f6a98c6c71ea609d1ed748377386a83e072d","sha":"14c0f6a98c6c71ea609d1ed748377386a83e072d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/14c0f6a98c6c71ea609d1ed748377386a83e072d"}],"sha":"0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/0cc8c8f7907970864208d8279c5d18d5aa8cc5b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23434985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Koushik-Deb","id":23434985,"login":"Koushik-Deb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNDM0OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koushik-Deb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/commits/14c0f6a98c6c71ea609d1ed748377386a83e072d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:44:39Z","email":"koushik.imon@gmail.com","name":"Koushik Deb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T18:44:39Z","email":"koushik.imon@gmail.com","name":"Koushik Deb"},"message":"feat(billing): replace scattered STRIPE_* gates with BILLING_ENABLED\n\nUpstream Postiz uses the presence of STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY /\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY as a proxy for \"is this a paid SaaS deployment or a\nfree self-hosted one?\", in 15 places across backend, frontend and\norchestrator. That conflates two independent questions: whether billing\nis enforced, and which gateway is configured.\n\nIt also meant billing was silently unenforced after the Polar migration\n— BILLING_PROVIDER=polar with no Stripe key left every org reporting as\nULTIMATE with 10,000 channels and all permission checks short-circuited,\neven though Polar checkout worked and wrote real Subscription rows.\n\nIntroduce isBillingEnabled() as the single source of truth and route\nevery gate through it:\n\n  BILLING_ENABLED   is billing enforced?   (literal \"true\")\n  BILLING_PROVIDER  which gateway?         (stripe | polar)\n\nThe only process.env.STRIPE_* reads left in the tree are the ones that\ngenuinely configure the gateway: the Stripe SDK constructor, the\nstripeClient prop feeding loadStripe(), STRIPE_SIGNING_KEY in the\nwebhook controller, and STRIPE_DISCOUNT_ID.\n\nDefaults are unchanged — unset BILLING_ENABLED gives the same\nfree/self-hosted behaviour upstream gives with no Stripe key.\n\nTwo judgement calls in (app)/layout.tsx: `dub` (referral attribution,\nrides on checkout metadata) and Plausible (analytics) were on the same\ngate and move with it. Behaviour is identical either way.\n\nAlso: add .env.prod to .gitignore, and drop STRIPE_SIGNING_KEY_CONNECT\nand FEE_AMOUNT from .env.example — both are unreferenced in the code.\n\nDeliberate divergence from upstream; kept in one commit to keep future\n`git merge upstream/main` readable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b8d3586f39f53d2043b783c8a9cb94e4e8d0bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/trees/8b8d3586f39f53d2043b783c8a9cb94e4e8d0bef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aitechnologysys-sys/veroza/git/commits/14c0f6a98c6c71ea609d1ed748377386a83e072d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned